364
00:22:00,550 --> 00:22:01,550
Se quiser passear,

365
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:02,590
quando chegar a primavera do próximo ano,

366
00:22:02,610 --> 00:22:03,920
iremos à loja de Nanjing

367
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:05,070
