388
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:07,830
Jingyuan nos braços.

389
00:23:14,110 --> 00:23:18,030
Os tempos antigos eram bons.

390
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:20,880
Havia esperança.

391
00:23:25,480 --> 00:23:26,550
Agora,

392
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:28,790
eu, esta nora

393
00:23:29,440 --> 00:23:31,290
