434
00:25:37,310 --> 00:25:39,640
Claro que me lembro.

435
00:25:40,830 --> 00:25:43,550
♪ Bolinho de Cabaça ♪

436
00:25:46,400 --> 00:25:47,440
Vovó Rujun!

437
00:25:47,790 --> 00:25:50,240
